    {
     "type": "practice",
     "title": "Practice: Write Your 90-Day Deliberate-Practice Plan",
     "content": "Build the plan, using Maya's example as a template. (1) TARGET: from your triangulated assessment, take your weakest verified domain and convert it into ONE specific, observable behavior (not 'be more X' but a concrete action you can catch yourself doing or not doing). (2) TRIGGER: define the exact situation that should cue the behavior ('when I notice my jaw clench in a meeting'). (3) REPS: identify where you'll get enough real practice instances, and if needed, deliberately create more. (4) FEEDBACK: design your loop — a daily log, a trusted person who will flag you, an outcome you can track. (5) REVIEW POINTS: schedule 30/60/90-day check-ins to adjust the target. Write it on one page. The test of a good plan: someone else could read it and tell whether you did it today.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Practice: Your 90-Day Plan</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">One page, five components</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"170\" width=\"940\" height=\"150\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.15)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"225\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\">1. Target</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"275\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">Weakest verified domain → ONE observable behavior</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"335\" width=\"940\" height=\"150\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.15)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"390\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\">2. Trigger</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"440\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">The exact cue: \"when my jaw clenches in a meeting\"</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"500\" width=\"940\" height=\"150\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"555\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\">3. Reps</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"605\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">Where will real practice instances come from?</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"665\" width=\"940\" height=\"150\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"720\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-weight=\"bold\">4. Feedback</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"770\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">Daily log, a person who flags you, a trackable outcome</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"830\" width=\"940\" height=\"150\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.15)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"885\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\">5. Review at 30 / 60 / 90 days</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"935\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#fff\">Test: could someone else tell whether you did it today?</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Target, trigger, reps, feedback, review — a one-page actionable plan."
     }
    },
    {
     "type": "practice",
     "title": "Practice: The Daily Two-Minute EQ Review",
     "content": "Sustain development past the plan with a nightly habit. Each evening, spend two minutes on three questions about the day's emotionally significant moment: (1) AWARENESS — what did I feel, and did I notice it in real time or only later? (2) RESPONSE — how did I handle it, and did my response fit the situation (Aristotle's standard from Lesson 1: right degree, right time, right way)? (3) REDO — if a similar moment comes tomorrow, what one thing would I do differently? Keep a running log. This is deliberate practice in miniature: it forces daily reflection (feedback), keeps a specific behavior in focus, and — over weeks — turns scattered emotional experiences into a visible trajectory of improvement. It also makes self-awareness, the keystone, a daily exercised muscle rather than an idea.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Practice: 2-Minute Nightly Review</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Make the keystone a daily muscle</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"180\" width=\"940\" height=\"170\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.15)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"235\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\">1. Awareness</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"285\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">What did I feel — and did I notice it in real</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"320\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">time, or only afterward?</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"370\" width=\"940\" height=\"190\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"425\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\">2. Response</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"475\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">Did my response FIT? (Aristotle's standard:</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"510\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">right degree, right time, right way)</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"545\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#888\">From Lesson 1 — the goal was never no emotion.</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"580\" width=\"940\" height=\"170\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.15)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"635\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\">3. Redo</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"685\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">If it recurs tomorrow, what ONE thing would</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"720\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">I do differently?</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"770\" width=\"940\" height=\"210\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.15)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"830\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Why It Works</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"890\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">Daily feedback + a focused behavior + a running log</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"930\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">turns scattered experience into a visible trajectory.</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"970\" font-size=\"18\" fill=\"#888\">Deliberate practice, shrunk to two minutes a night.</text></svg>",
      "caption": "A nightly awareness-response-redo review keeps EQ development alive."
     }
    }
