     "explanation": "A synthesis of more than 200 studies found that, alongside gains in social behavior and reductions in conduct problems and emotional distress, students in SEL programs showed an academic achievement advantage of about eleven percentile points on average compared to peers who did not receive such programming, though the size of the benefit varied with how well each program was actually implemented.",
