      "svg": "<svg viewBox='0 0 1100 1100'><rect width='1100' height='1100' fill='#1a1a2e'/><text x='550' y='70' font-size='26' fill='#ffd700' text-anchor='middle'>Same Trigger, Two Different Outcomes</text><rect x='100' y='140' width='420' height='840' rx='16' fill='#ef4444' opacity='0.15' stroke='#ef4444' stroke-width='3'/><text x='310' y='190' font-size='22' fill='#ef4444' text-anchor='middle'>Hijacked Response</text><circle cx='150' cy='260' r='8' fill='#ef4444'/><text x='175' y='266' font-size='16' fill='#ffffff'>car cuts you off</text><circle cx='150' cy='320' r='8' fill='#ef4444'/><text x='175' y='326' font-size='16' fill='#ffffff'>heart races, jaw clenches</text><circle cx='150' cy='380' r='8' fill='#ef4444'/><text x='175' y='386' font-size='16' fill='#ffffff'>horn, shouting, tailgating</text><circle cx='150' cy='440' r='8' fill='#ef4444'/><text x='175' y='446' font-size='16' fill='#ffffff'>reasoning arrives too late</text><circle cx='150' cy='500' r='8' fill='#ef4444'/><text x='175' y='506' font-size='16' fill='#ffffff'>regret sets in minutes later</text><rect x='580' y='140' width='420' height='840' rx='16' fill='#10b981' opacity='0.15' stroke='#10b981' stroke-width='3'/><text x='790' y='190' font-size='22' fill='#10b981' text-anchor='middle'>Regulated Response</text><circle cx='630' cy='260' r='8' fill='#10b981'/><text x='655' y='266' font-size='16' fill='#ffffff'>car cuts you off</text><circle cx='630' cy='320' r='8' fill='#10b981'/><text x='655' y='326' font-size='16' fill='#ffffff'>notices racing heart</text><circle cx='630' cy='380' r='8' fill='#10b981'/><text x='655' y='386' font-size='16' fill='#ffffff'>names it: this is a hijack</text><circle cx='630' cy='440' r='8' fill='#10b981'/><text x='655' y='446' font-size='16' fill='#ffffff'>slow exhale, loosens grip</text><circle cx='630' cy='500' r='8' fill='#10b981'/><text x='655' y='506' font-size='16' fill='#ffffff'>cortex re-engages, drives on</text><text x='550' y='1030' font-size='16' fill='#888' text-anchor='middle'>The trigger and the biology are identical; the outcome is not</text></svg>",
      "caption": "The same low-road signal can lead to a hijacked reaction or a regulated one"
